        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Teton Rock Gym – Fitness Area Improvement Project 2020</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/49577.webp" alt="Teton Rock Gym – Fitness Area Improvement Project 2020" loading="lazy">
